{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Vijaya","html":"<article id='thag1.92'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.92 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.92 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dasamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Ten </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Vijayattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Vijaya </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Yassāsavā parikkhīṇā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>One whose defilements have ended; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>āhāre ca anissito; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>who’s not attached to food; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Suññato animitto ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>whose range is the liberation </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>vimokkho yassa gocaro; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>of the signless and the empty: </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ākāseva sakuntānaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>their track is hard to trace, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>padaṁ tassa durannayan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>like birds in the sky. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Vijayo thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
